"after": " passado.</p></div></div>\n<figure class=\"approved-figure\" aria-label=\"Comparação da lei, da prática alegada e das posições das autoridades no caso Beruti\" data-src=\"aula-07.html#c5\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:28px auto 32px;padding:18px clamp(14px,3vw,28px);border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:6px 6px 0 var(--grid-major);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">\n<figcaption style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--ink-2);font:500 12px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase\">Lei, prática e posições no caso Beruti</figcaption>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;color:var(--ink);font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans)\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);background:var(--paper-2);text-align:left;font:600 11px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Referência</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);background:var(--paper-2);text-align:left;font:600 11px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Posição</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);background:var(--paper-2);text-align:left;font:600 11px/1.35 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Alcance no caso</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Lei indiana de 1609</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Proibia formalizar como empréstimo uma venda de mercadorias.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">A infração podia levar à perda da quantia.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Beruti e a prática alegada</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Beruti invocou uso americano; a Audiencia de Charcas admitia tais escrituras.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">A prática local contestava a aplicação da proibição.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Audiencia de Buenos Aires</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Aplicou a lei ao identificar uma venda; depois hesitou e consultou a Coroa.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">A prática de Charcas e a lei categórica mantiveram a controvérsia.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Fiscal do Conselho</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Defendeu a aplicação literal e negou os requisitos jurídicos do costume.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Sua posição não encerrou o processo.</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:600 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Segunda sala do Conselho</th><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">Mandou devolver as quantias e pediu informação sobre a inobservância da lei.</td><td style=\"padding:9px 10px;border:1px solid var(--grid-major);vertical-align:top;text-align:left;font:400 14px/1.45 var(--sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere\">O Conselho não resolveu a aplicação futura da proibição.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></figure><section class=\"chapter\" aria-labelledby=\"c7\"><span class=\"num dif\" aria-hidden=\"true\">07</span><h2 id=\"c7\">07"
